Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: /* empty */
    2        | declaration_list

    3 declaration_list: declaration
    4                 | declaration_list declaration

    5 declaration: function_declaration
    6            | variable_declaration TOK_SEMICOLON
    7            | struct_declaration TOK_SEMICOLON

    8 type_specifier: TOK_INT
    9               | TOK_INT8
   10               | TOK_INT16
   11               | TOK_INT32
   12               | TOK_INT64
   13               | TOK_SHORT
   14               | TOK_FLOAT
   15               | TOK_CHAR
