  116                 | TOK_AMP unary_expression
  117                 | TOK_STAR unary_expression
  118                 | TOK_SIZEOF TOK_LPAREN type_specifier TOK_RPAREN

  119 postfix_expression: primary_expression
  120                   | postfix_expression TOK_LBRACKET expression TOK_RBRACKET
  121                   | postfix_expression TOK_LPAREN argument_list TOK_RPAREN
  122                   | postfix_expression TOK_LPAREN TOK_RPAREN
  123                   | postfix_expression TOK_DOT TOK_IDENTIFIER
  124                   | postfix_expression TOK_ARROW TOK_IDENTIFIER
